# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-3 window (octo-T8 and its three levers on the fused stack; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-3 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo3-1 is the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (the oneq arm needs its binary; every other arm runs that
# binary with the lever off). A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B0 (STOP): the window image tp4-octo3-1: the fusion pack's B0 (the image built from the pushed branch head with the PRODUCTION profile
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic baked as its serving default and a session cap of 8) plus C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ, so that the image's _ttnncpp.so is
# K64j plus the prefill factory's oneq edits (flag 0x8, inert unless QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1) and the oneq arm A2 can run on it. THE IMAGE IS A GATE-WINDOW IMAGE ONLY
# (packed_any_admission accepts the K64j-OQ binary in a gate boot on the K64j records, and in a traffic boot only on records made on it). It carries the octo modules,
# audit_sampling and every fusion package's files (the overlay manifest). READ: "baking the serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic with a
# session cap of 8", the provenance report with no problem line and its K64j-OQ graft line, the image id. A build, not a card job. Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo3-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
